<!DOCTYPE html><!--3O3FqRE8PBYZqFlqGA4eh--><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/74f010e327d185db.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/255-b1e2483a7e02feee.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-2ecc3bf42ae2d122.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-b4c5d0f0711057d4.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/455-69ed79fd04de90a2.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/page-cf9c78d5068d2fbd.js" async=""></script><title>Formulário para Denúncia de assédio eleitoral no ambiente de trabalho</title><meta name="description" content="Canal oficial para denunciar assédio eleitoral no ambiente de trabalho."/><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" sizes="16x16"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.png?6e4fd0ff36971f2a" type="image/png" sizes="32x32"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-icon.png?353f87a6843a4e19" type="image/png" sizes="180x180"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a class="pular" href="#conteudo">Ir para o conteúdo</a><header class="cabecalho"><div class="cabecalho-interno"><p class="marca">gov.br</p><p class="orgao">Ministério do Trabalho e Emprego</p></div></header><div class="faixa"></div><main id="conteudo" class="conteudo"><article class="pagina"><h1>Formulário para Denúncia de assédio eleitoral no ambiente de trabalho</h1><p class="intro">Use este canal para registrar uma denúncia de assédio eleitoral no ambiente de trabalho.</p><form class="formulario" noValidate=""><fieldset><legend>Dados pessoais</legend><div class="campo"><label for="nome">Nome<span class="opcional"> (Opcional)</span></label><input id="nome" type="text" autoComplete="name" maxLength="200" aria-invalid="false" name="nome" value=""/></div><div class="campo"><label for="celular">Celular<span class="opcional"> (Opcional)</span></label><input id="celular" type="tel" autoComplete="tel" inputMode="numeric" placeholder="(00) 00000-0000" maxLength="15" aria-invalid="false" name="celular" value=""/></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Dados da empresa e do fato</legend><div class="campo"><label for="empresaNome">Nome da empresa ou empregador</label><input id="empresaNome" type="text" required="" aria-required="true" maxLength="300" aria-invalid="false" name="empresaNome" value=""/></div><div class="campo"><label for="cnpj">CPF/CNPJ do empregador<span class="opcional"> (Opcional)</span></label><input id="cnpj" type="text" inputMode="numeric" autoComplete="off" placeholder="000.000.000-00 ou 00.000.000/0000-00" maxLength="18" aria-invalid="false" name="cnpj" value=""/></div><div class="campo"><label for="rua">Rua</label><input id="rua" type="text" required="" aria-required="true" autoComplete="address-line1" maxLength="200" aria-invalid="false" name="rua" value=""/></div><div class="grade grade-numero"><div class="campo"><label for="numero">Número<span class="opcional"> (Opcional)</span></label><input id="numero" type="text" autoComplete="off" maxLength="20" aria-invalid="false" name="numero" value=""/></div><div class="campo"><label for="complemento">Complemento<span class="opcional"> (Opcional)</span></label><input id="complemento" type="text" autoComplete="address-line2" maxLength="120" aria-invalid="false" name="complemento" value=""/></div></div><div class="campo"><label for="bairro">Bairro</label><input id="bairro" type="text" required="" aria-required="true" autoComplete="address-level3" maxLength="120" aria-invalid="false" name="bairro" value=""/></div><div class="grade"><div class="campo"><label for="cidade">Cidade</label><input id="cidade" type="text" required="" aria-required="true" autoComplete="address-level2" maxLength="120" aria-invalid="false" name="cidade" value=""/></div><div class="campo"><label for="estado">Estado</label><select id="estado" name="estado" required="" aria-required="true" autoComplete="address-level1" aria-invalid="false"><option value="" selected="">Selecione</option><option value="AC">AC</option><option value="AL">AL</option><option value="AP">AP</option><option value="AM">AM</option><option value="BA">BA</option><option value="CE">CE</option><option value="DF">DF</option><option value="ES">ES</option><option value="GO">GO</option><option value="MA">MA</option><option value="MT">MT</option><option value="MS">MS</option><option value="MG">MG</option><option value="PA">PA</option><option value="PB">PB</option><option value="PR">PR</option><option value="PE">PE</option><option value="PI">PI</option><option value="RJ">RJ</option><option value="RN">RN</option><option value="RS">RS</option><option value="RO">RO</option><option value="RR">RR</option><option value="SC">SC</option><option value="SP">SP</option><option value="SE">SE</option><option value="TO">TO</option></select></div></div><div class="campo"><label for="descricao">Descrição do fato</label><textarea id="descricao" name="descricao" required="" aria-required="true" minLength="20" maxLength="8000" rows="8" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="descricao-ajuda"></textarea><p class="dica" id="descricao-ajuda">Mínimo de 20 caracteres.</p></div><div class="campo"><label for="arquivos">Anexos<span class="opcional"> (Opcional)</span></label><p class="ajuda" id="arquivos-ajuda">Imagem, vídeo, áudio ou PDF. Até <!-- -->5<!-- --> arquivos, 300 MB cada.</p><input id="arquivos" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,video/mp4,video/webm,video/quicktime,audio/mpeg,audio/mp4,audio/wav,audio/x-wav,audio/ogg,audio/webm,application/pdf" multiple="" aria-describedby="arquivos-ajuda" name="arquivos"/></div></fieldset><div class="campo"><p class="label-captcha">Confirme que você não é um robô</p><div class="g-recaptcha" data-sitekey="6Lf6EQQuAAAAAPAzufI9yR0CKNrR4NwFFBYfuhlD" data-theme="light" data-size="normal"></div></div><div class="acoes"><button class="botao-enviar" type="submit">Enviar denúncia</button></div></form></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="rodape"><p>Ministério do Trabalho e Emprego</p><p>assedioeleitoral.trabalho.gov.br</p></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[1390,[\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-b4c5d0f0711057d4.js\"],\"UploadProvider\"]\n3:I[9766,[],\"\"]\n4:I[8924,[],\"\"]\n5:I[4880,[\"455\",\"static/chunks/455-69ed79fd04de90a2.js\",\"974\",\"static/chunks/app/page-cf9c78d5068d2fbd.js\"],\"FormularioDenuncia\"]\n6:I[4431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n8:I[5278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\na:I[4431,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[4431,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\nd:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\nf:I[7150,[],\"\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/74f010e327d185db.css\",\"style\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"3O3FqRE8PBYZqFlqGA4eh\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[\"\",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/74f010e327d185db.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"pt-BR\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"pular\",\"href\":\"#conteudo\",\"children\":\"Ir para o conteúdo\"}],[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"cabecalho\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",nu